                  "Children": [
                    {
                      "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                      "Text": "* \tTrial location: Barhill, Canterbury\n*\tCoordinates:43.757°S, 171.932°E\n*\tSoil: Templeton\n*\tWeather station: Chertsey Cws\n*\tThis experiment evaluated oat populations (i.e. target of 0 [fallow],150, 300 plants/m2) \n*\tNote that these populations were not achieved so, actual plant counts are used in the model (see factors).\n* \tThe paddock was previously in a kale crop\n*\tThis is a grazed field and grazing occured on the winter (kale) crop prior to sowing oats\n*\tA total of 100 kg N/ha as urea was applied to oats & the crop grown to grain.\n",
                      "Name": "Experiment Description",
                      "ResourceName": null,
                      "Children": [],
                      "Enabled": true,
                      "ReadOnly": false
                    },
