                                      },
                                      {
                                        "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                                        "Text": "# Comparing cultivars Coronet and PFR 100-05\n\n- Data collected by **Mike George**\n- Data sits in: https://iplant.plantandfood.co.nz/project/I161208\n\n## Context: \n- PFR 100-05 showed faster canopy cloure rates via drone aerial photos\n- Field trial was done to identify mechanisms. \n\n##Main differences between cultivars were:\n\n- Larger leaves by PRR 100-05 (45-80% larger)\n- Taller stems by PFR 100-05 (50% taller)\n\n## Observations\n\n- We agreed to keep only leaf size as genotype difference. Height also differed as:\n- [Structure].HeightModel.PotentialHeight.XYPairs.Y = 13,204,820,820\n- [Structure].HeightModel.PotentialHeight.XYPairs.Y = 20,300,1200,1200",
                                        "Name": "ReadMe",
                                        "ResourceName": null,
                                        "Children": [],
                                        "Enabled": true,
                                        "ReadOnly": false
                                      }
