              "ResourceName": null,
              "Children": [
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                  "Text": "This experiment was run at DPI Wellcamp Research Station, Queensland in 2006.\r\nPhenology data (Zadok stage) was the only data collected.\r\n\r\nThis experiment was a phenology experiment based on small and narrow observation plots (4 rows) in conjunction with a QDAF Oats breeing trial. The decision was taken to use a nearby SILO met-data set rather than the onsite weather station, due to the possibility that the onsite met station had not been calibrated for some time.",
                  "Name": "Memo",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                },
