              "Name": "LRCphenology",
              "ResourceName": null,
              "Children": [
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                  "Text": "These simulations were used to develop phenology parameters for a range of cultivars used in northern Australia. Observed data was kindly supplied by Bruce Winter (Oats Breeder) and Richard Uebergang from experiments conducted at DAFQ Leslie Research Centre, Holberton St Toowoomba. SILO weather data from the nearby Toowoomba Airport was used. Approximated irrigation data and fertiliser regime was provided by LRC staff who managed the phenology screening trials to be non-water and N limiting. ",
                  "Name": "Memo",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                },
